# Facts about Nessa Quill.

@fact nessa.editor
tier: surface
text: Editor of the Lumen Ledger, with a quill that writes on its own.

@fact nessa.quill
tier: personal
hint: Watch her quill when she isn't.
unlock: seen(nessa_burnout) > 0
text: Left unsupervised, her quill starts inventing the news.

@fact nessa.interview
tier: personal
hint: Ask her what story she wants most.
unlock: rel(nessa) >= 12
text: Nobody has interviewed the headmistress in twenty years. She means to be the first.

@fact nessa.string
tier: secret
hint: See what's pinned to her office wall.
unlock: seen(nessa_hollow_story) > 0
text: Her office wall is covered in red string around a sketch of a black star.

@fact nessa.press
tier: personal
hint: See what happens if someone threatens the Ledger.
unlock: seen(nessa_paper_threatened) > 0
text: She would chain herself to the printing press before letting anyone shut the Ledger.

@fact nessa.off_record
tier: secret
hint: There's one phrase that stops her quill.
unlock: seen(nessa_confession) > 0
text: The only time her quill stops is when she tells it the conversation is off the record.

@fact nessa.planted
tier: personal
hint: Check her proofs for her.
unlock: seen(nessa_fact_check) > 0
text: She plants one error in every proof she asks you to check, to see whether you'll find it.
